<<<
dictate. Accent the noun (usu. pl.) di‘ktat(s), the verb dikta’t; see NOUN & VERB ACCENT.
===
**dictate.** Accent the noun (usu. pl.) dĭ'ktāt(s), the verb dĭktā't; see ^^NOUN & VERB ACCENT^^.
>>>

<<<
dictatress, -trix. The -ess form is preferable in such words of the kind as are for ordinary & not merely legal use; & the OED quotes Byron, Scott, & Helps, for dictatress.
===
**dictatress, -trix.** The *-ess* form is preferable in such words of the kind as are for ordinary & not merely legal use; & the OED quotes Byron, Scott, & Helps, for *dictatress.*
>>>

